<figure class="pipe-test" aria-labelledby="pipe-test-title">
  <figcaption id="pipe-test-title"><span>MEASURED LIMITATION</span><strong>Pipes move bytes; they do not become a terminal</strong></figcaption>
  <div class="pipe-test__actors"><b>Core Surface</b><i aria-hidden="true">spawns</i><b><code>/bin/sh</code></b></div>
  <dl>
    <div><dt>stdin</dt><dd>ignored / pipe semantics</dd><strong>isatty = no</strong></div>
    <div><dt>stdout</dt><dd>captured byte pipe</dd><strong>isatty = no</strong></div>
    <div><dt>stderr</dt><dd>captured byte pipe</dd><strong>isatty = no</strong></div>
  </dl>
  <aside><strong>Still missing</strong><span>terminal device · session · controlling terminal · foreground process group · window size · terminal modes</span></aside>
</figure>
